  - m_Id: 1013338148
    m_Localized: Developed by Ramin Rasulzade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338149
    m_Localized: "Unity 6000.6 (URP) \u2022 Apple Metal \u2022 WebGPU"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338150
    m_Localized: HOW TO PLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338151
    m_Localized: 1. CONTROLS & LAUNCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338152
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Drag touch or mouse horizontally to guide the paddle.\n\u2022 Keyboard: A/D or Left/Right arrows.\n\u2022 Tap screen, click, or press Up/Space to launch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338153
    m_Localized: 2. DYNAMIC PADDLE DEFLECTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338154
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Rebounds calculate angle from hit offset! Center bounces vertical (90\xB0); outer edges yield sharp angles (30\xB0) for surgical precision."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338155
    m_Localized: 3. SCORING & GLASS BRICKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338156
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Red = 10 pts \u2022 Green = 20 pts \u2022 Blue = 30 pts.\n\u2022 Glass Bricks require 2 hits: Hit 1 shatters the protective shell; Hit 2 breaks the brick for 2x points!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338157
    m_Localized: 4. POWERUPS & HAZARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338158
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Expander: Widens paddle by +10%.\n\u2022 Multipliers: 2X, 3X, 4X, 5X bonus points per block.\n\u2022 Shield: Kinetic barrier protects for 10s.\n\u2022 Multi-Ball: 3 balls! Extra balls don't lose lives.\n\u2022 Laser Blaster: Twin cannons pierce brick rows!\n\u2022 Bombs: Radial detonation explodes neighbors!\n\u2022 Extra Heart: Grants +1 life (up to 5 max).\n\u2022 Clutch Countdown: When 1 brick remains, 12s timer yields up to 10X score or Railgun vaporizes it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
